flowchart TD
  STATS[Observation cycles and no-READY stall count] --> HYS[Hysteresis controller]
  HYS --> LIMIT[active_bank_limit = 2, 3, or 4]
  LIMIT --> SCHED[Existing availability-driven scheduler]
  SOURCE[Tile source] --> LOAD[Shared loader]
  LOAD --> SCHED
  SCHED --> BANKS[Four physical scratchpad banks]
  BANKS --> MAC[One synchronous-read MAC engine]
  MAC --> STATS
  MAC --> RESULT[Tile ID and verified result]
